        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "When I purchased my property back in 2014, I complemented Hussam for being an outstanding real estate agent with suburb service and commitment. He made the purchase seamless and easy with support excellent support and assistance in every aspect. I told him he is a one stop shop for purchasing as he arranged and recommended all required services to complete the purchase all of whom has been outstanding (inspection, mortgage, notary and insurance). In 2024 I decided to rent out the property and it was without a doubt back to Hussam to manage and as always, he did an outstanding job and made it happen as always easy and seamless. My highest appreciation and complement to you Hussam for being an outstanding committed support. Highly recommended for anybody who wants to purchase or rent a property with peace of mind and highest level of professional work.",
